// Home page v6 (22 Nov 2026). Owner's review of v5: too much text, screens that all looked alike, a "straight talk"
// section that raised our weak spot, the syllabus garden gone, and no ask to sign up. "The job of the website is to
// convert every visitor into at least a free sign up, and where possible into a sale." So: real, very different screens
// up top, the garden, one short row per feature with a real screen, a PYQ to try right here, and Join free everywhere.
// Chotu (Dock.astro) talks the visitor through it: every section has a data-say line.
// Rules kept: no "AI" labels and never a claim that a person marked something; no toppers, testimonials or promised
// results; ₹3,999 a year; sound off. English and Hindi side by side (T), the Hindi in everyday words.
